        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:WiLond">Wl Lond</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="4" corresp="#wit-original">7 ic nelle geþolian þæt ænig man eow ænig wrang beode.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-original">And I will not suffer any man to offer you any wrong.</ab>
